[Mission.Objectives]
Defend against a new German offensive.
[Mission.Description]
To prevent being encircled, the German High Command has launched a small, but fierce counter attack called Operation Ludditch.

Your order:
- 	Stop the German offensive
[Mission.Success]
Mission accomplished. The massive offensive has been stopped.
[Mission.Failed]
The German attack has succeeded and we have sustained heavy casualties.
[Submission1.Objectives]
Attack the group of the enemy’s forces.
[Submission1.Description]
Recon reports that the first phase of the German attack seems to be coming at us from the Northeast. 

Your order is:
- 	Attack the enemy units advancing in from the Northeast.
[Submission1.Success]
Mission accomplished. The enemy forces are retreating.
[Submission1.Failed]
Mission failed. Your troops have been defeated.
[Submission2.Objectives]
Attack the enemy forces.
[Submission2.Description]
The German offensive continues and now it appears that he is going to attack us from the East.

Your orders:
- 	Attack the enemy units advancing from the East.
[Submission2.Success]
Mission accomplished. The enemy attack has been stopped.
[Submission2.Failed]
Mission failed. Your troops are destroyed.
[Submission3.Objectives]
Attack the troops approaching from the North.
[Submission3.Description]
The day is not won yet. Another enemy attack is being prepared from the North. This time they outnumber us but you must prevail.

Your orders:
- 	Destroy the main German assault.
[Submission3.Success]
Mission accomplished. This phase of the enemy plan has been stopped.
[Submission3.Failed]
Mission failed. The enemy offensive was a success, and your troops are destroyed.
[StringTable.Reserve
Reinforcements have arrived.
[Submission4.Objectives]
Attack the German forces.
[Submission4.Description]
We have held out so far, but it seems the Germans are about to prepare one last attack, this time originating from the East.

Your orders:
- 	Attack the enemy forces approaching from the East and prevent an encirclement of our forces.
[Submission4.Success]
Mission accomplished. The enemy failed to break through and encircle our forces.
[Submission4.Failed]
Mission failed. Your troops are destroyed.
[StringTable.Subtitle_01]
France. August 1944
[StringTable.Reserv]
Reinforcements have arrived.